⚡🇷🇴🇷🇺Two Russian drones found drifting near Romania's Neptun Deep project in the Black Sea were destroyed by a controlled detonation carried out by Romanian EOD divers.

The drones were discovered approximately 167 km from Constanța, within Romania's EEZ, after being spotted by a vessel in the area. 

